extends layout

block content
  h2.heading-text Welcome to Cloud Drive!
  p.subtitle-text We're excited to have you on board, #{userName}!
  
  p Your account has been successfully created. You can now start uploading, sharing, and managing your files with ease.
  
  .alert-box.alert-info
    strong Pro Tip: 
    | You can enable security alerts in your settings to stay informed about your account activity.
  
  a.button(href=actionUrl || '#') Go to My Files
  
  p.small-text If you have any questions, feel free to reply to this email or visit our help center.
